    parts: ["Front wiper blade set (driver + passenger), builds from 09/2009 incl. 2010 328i/328i xDrive. BimmerWorld and Turner list it for 2010+. — 61612455435 [verified]", "Prior revision of that set (Valeo mfr nos. 900-24-8B / 900-19-6B, listed 2010-2011 on a 335d page) — 61612159627 [verified]", "Pre-09/2009 E90 set (not for a 2010 build) — 61610427668 [verified]", "Another genuine E90 set listed without production date — 61612468941 [single]", "Passenger wiper arm for builds from 09/2009 (only if the arm is damaged) — 61619449924 [single]", "Aftermarket equivalent lengths for builds from 2009-09-01: 600 mm (24 in) driver, 475 mm (19 in) passenger, B-type mounting [single]", "Fluid: Windshield washer fluid (to test the new blades) — MISSING (not researched; any automotive washer fluid), MISSING [missing]"],
